  "steps": [
    "Soak 3/4 cup moong dal for atleast 1-2 hours (or overnight).",
    "Then drain the water, add to a blender, add 1/2 inch ginger, 2 green chillies & 1/4 cup water & blend smooth.",
    "Then add this to a bowl add 1 tsp cumin seeds, 1 tsp salt, 1 tsp red chilli powder & a pinch of haldi.",
    "Also add 1/2 carrot finely chopped, 1 onion, 1/2 capsicum finely chopped, handful of coriander & mix it well.",
    "Finally add 1 tbsp rice flour, mix & right at the end when your pan is ready add 1/2 tsp eno & mix (not too much).",
    "Heat oil in a pan, grease it well. Pour the batter over this & spread it evenly.",
    "Cover with a lid, let it steam for 3-4 mins until it hardens.",
    "Now let it cook once done, flip it over & cook on the other side too.",
    "Now make a slit in the middle add some butter let it cook for another minute or so.",
    "Now slice it up & enjoy with some bhujiya, coriander & green chutney!"
  ],
